<title>BANGLADESH: Chittagong port handles 15,601 tonnes of cargo.</title>
<headline>Chittagong port handles 15,601 tonnes of cargo.</headline>
<dateline>CHITTAGONG, Bangladesh 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chittagong port handled 15,601 tonnes of export and import cargo in the 24 hours ending 1.00 p.m. (0700 GMT) on Thursday, compared with 12,619 tonnes in the same period on Wednesday, port officials said.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>					Thursday		Previous</p>
<p>    Export cargo		   1,831		   3,117</p>
<p>    Import cargo		  13,770		   9,502</p>
<p>Berthing schedule of major vessels unloading or expected to unload at Chittagong port:</p>
<p>    Commodity	   Tonnes     Ship	     Berthing</p>
<p>    Crude oil	   99,874     Aspilos	  18/10</p>
<p>    Sugar		 13,772     Tasmia	   20/10</p>
<p>    Wheat		 25,000     Kea		21/10</p>
<p>    Wheat		 25,000     Prospathia	7/11</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom 880-2-506363</p>
</text>
